  "description": "Mail merge for DocWright Word templates: merge fields (including fields split across runs), repeating regions for tables and line items, nested relations, Word's IF/NEXT/SKIPIF rules, Address Block and Greeting Line, image merging, record preview, and one copy per record in place or in a new document. Binds from objects, dictionaries, CSV, an .xlsx sheet or your own reader, with no System.Data dependency. Culture is explicit, never ambient.",
